<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Varig posts Q1 net loss of 30.5 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Varig posts Q1 net loss of 30.5 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian national airline Varig issued the following statement on its January to March results.</p>
<p>			Jan-March 1997	     Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Net loss	     30.5 million		   n/a</p>
<p>    Net revenue	 774.7 million	     705.5 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais and according to Brazilian Generally Accepted Accounting Principles.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
</text>
